sequenceDiagram
  participant M as member
  participant S as guest (server)
  participant D as SQLite (shares)
  participant P as guest's page
  participant A as auth (memory)
  participant R as room
  M->>S: POST /api/rooms/<room>/shares {label, days}
  S->>D: id, room, SHA-256(secret), expiry
  S-->>M: <page>#zwf-guest=<secret> (shown once)
  M->>P: the link (by mail, chat)
  P->>S: POST /api/public/guest/join {secret, name}
  S->>A: session "<name> (guest)", until the expiry
  P->>R: WebSocket Auth (the session cookie)
  R->>S: Authorize: the share's room only
  S->>R: expiry, revocation: Disconnect (the reason)
